{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48801","headline":"□□□赵载同游焦湖夜归作 · 萧頴士","name":"□□□赵载同游焦湖夜归作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□将泽国，淜腾迎淮甸。\n东江输大江，别流从此县。\n仙尉俯胜境，轻桡恣游衍。\n自公暇有余，微尚得所愿。\n拈引间翰墨，风流尽欢宴。\n稍移井邑闲，始悦登眺便。\n遥岫逢应接，连塘乍回转。\n划然气象分，万顷行可见。\n波中峰一点，云际帆千片。\n浩叹无端涯，孰知蕴虚变。\n往游信不厌，毕景方未还。\n兰□烟霭里，延缘蒲稗间。\n势随风潮远，心与□□闲。\n回见出浦月，雄光射东关。\n悠然蓬壶事，□□□衰颜。\n安得傲吏隐，弥年寓兹山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧頴士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}